                SELECT DISTINCT
                     mg.MODULEGROUPNAME,
                     mg.MODULEGROUPCODE
                FROM IMART_TRANSACTIONS_VW a
                LEFT JOIN MODULE m ON a.MODULE_NAME = m.MODULECODE
                LEFT JOIN MODULEGROUP mg ON mg.MODULEGROUPCODE = m.MODULEGROUPCODE
                ```
